abstract: >-
  STRIDE threat modeling applied to a 23-agent bioinformatics orchestration system. 100-scenario attack suite (direct injection, indirect injection, multi-turn escalation, tool misuse). 4-component detection pipeline. 96% overall detection rate, 0/100 FPR on benign queries.
